      "start_seconds": 0.89,
      "end_seconds": 4.02,
      "duration_seconds": 3.13,
      "text": "Sorry I'm a little late, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 5.16,
      "end_seconds": 9.47,
      "duration_seconds": 4.31,
      "text": "Yes, have a seat. Tell me what's going on."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 11.36,
      "end_seconds": 13.06,
      "duration_seconds": 1.7,
      "text": "It's acne, mostly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 14.03,
      "end_seconds": 16.12,
      "duration_seconds": 2.09,
      "text": "Did it come on recently?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 16.88,
      "end_seconds": 19.94,
      "duration_seconds": 3.06,
      "text": "It's been about a month now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 34.32,
      "end_seconds": 37.16,
      "duration_seconds": 2.84,
      "text": "Any palpitations, headaches or milky nipple discharge?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 38.95,
      "end_seconds": 41.88,
      "duration_seconds": 2.93,
      "text": "yeah, no, none that I've noticed"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 43.37,
      "end_seconds": 46.83,
      "duration_seconds": 3.46,
      "text": "How about your heart, any problems like that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 48.92,
      "end_seconds": 50.58,
      "duration_seconds": 1.66,
      "text": "Nothing like that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 51.46,
      "end_seconds": 55.58,
      "duration_seconds": 4.12,
      "text": "Do you react to any medicines or foods? Any allergies?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 56.28,
      "end_seconds": 60.91,
      "duration_seconds": 4.63,
      "text": "let me think, no, not that I know of"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 72.77,
      "end_seconds": 75.68,
      "duration_seconds": 2.91,
      "text": "Right, have you had any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 76.39,
      "end_seconds": 80.89,
      "duration_seconds": 4.5,
      "text": "Right, uh, no, I've never been operated on."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 92.19,
      "end_seconds": 95.1,
      "duration_seconds": 2.91,
      "text": "Is there any regular medication you use?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 99.38,
      "end_seconds": 100.56,
      "duration_seconds": 1.18,
      "text": "No, none."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 101.19,
      "end_seconds": 104.01,
      "duration_seconds": 2.82,
      "text": "What line of work are you in?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 104.55,
      "end_seconds": 109.16,
      "duration_seconds": 4.61,
      "text": "I'm a bus driver, so I sit for long hours."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 113.14,
      "end_seconds": 114.91,
      "duration_seconds": 1.77,
      "text": "How are your meals?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 115.71,
      "end_seconds": 119.87,
      "duration_seconds": 4.16,
      "text": "I grab fast food at lunch most days"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 120.56,
      "end_seconds": 122.12,
      "duration_seconds": 1.56,
      "text": "Who lives with you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 123.92,
      "end_seconds": 126.58,
      "duration_seconds": 2.66,
      "text": "My partner and our baby."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 130.44,
      "end_seconds": 135.25,
      "duration_seconds": 4.81,
      "text": "do you have any medical conditions I should know about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 135.86,
      "end_seconds": 139.53,
      "duration_seconds": 3.67,
      "text": "Yeah, no, I've always been fairly healthy."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 140.15,
      "end_seconds": 143.55,
      "duration_seconds": 3.4,
      "text": "Time for your numbers, if that's okay."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 154.44,
      "end_seconds": 156.53,
      "duration_seconds": 2.09,
      "text": "Sit still for a moment..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 174.82,
      "end_seconds": 185.45,
      "duration_seconds": 10.63,
      "text": "okay: saturation 98 percent, temperature is 36.5 degrees, height 157 centimetres and pressure 128 over 81, pulse is 67 beats a minute, weight 60 kilos"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 187.28,
      "end_seconds": 190.81,
      "duration_seconds": 3.53,
      "text": "Erm, you know, is that alright, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 192.57,
      "end_seconds": 194.75,
      "duration_seconds": 2.18,
      "text": "We'll go over that shortly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 196.92,
      "end_seconds": 199.6,
      "duration_seconds": 2.68,
      "text": "let's move on to the examination"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 201.05,
      "end_seconds": 202.59,
      "duration_seconds": 1.54,
      "text": "yeah, no problem"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 203.51,
      "end_seconds": 204.81,
      "duration_seconds": 1.3,
      "text": "Look straight ahead."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 219.62,
      "end_seconds": 227.77,
      "duration_seconds": 8.15,
      "text": "your weight is up a little, and there is acne on the jaw and some coarse hairs on the chin"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 233.46,
      "end_seconds": 235.07,
      "duration_seconds": 1.61,
      "text": "Please sit back down."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 252.79,
      "end_seconds": 258.46,
      "duration_seconds": 5.67,
      "text": "Right, here's what I'm thinking. It fits best with polycystic ovary syndrome."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 259.88,
      "end_seconds": 262.61,
      "duration_seconds": 2.73,
      "text": "Is there something to worry about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 264.42,
      "end_seconds": 275.76,
      "duration_seconds": 11.34,
      "text": "It's reasonable to be concerned, but right now polycystic ovary syndrome is my leading thought, not anything worse. Let's book a thyroid test to look into irregular periods."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 277.39,
      "end_seconds": 280.72,
      "duration_seconds": 3.33,
      "text": "Where would I go for that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 283.48,
      "end_seconds": 310.47,
      "duration_seconds": 26.99,
      "text": "I'm prescribing metformin, 500 milligrams, twice a day with food, long term. That's for polycystic ovaries. Regular exercise and a lower-sugar diet help the periods settle. One warning sign to remember: the symptoms get worse. In that case don't wait. See me again after the results. Anything else on your mind before you go?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 311.64,
      "end_seconds": 315.6,
      "duration_seconds": 3.96,
      "text": "let me think, thank you, doctor, goodbye"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 317.58,
      "end_seconds": 319.8,
      "duration_seconds": 2.22,
      "text": "alright, have a good day"
    }
  ]
}